  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Thai fish cakes serve 4 as a snack or starter and take about 30 minutes plus chilling. The mix is built from blended "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "white fish fillet",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "white-fish-fillet"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " with "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "kaffir lime leaves",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "kaffir-lime-leaves"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "fish sauce",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "fish-sauce"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Chilling the mix for 30 minutes makes the patties much easier to shape and helps them hold together during frying."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Blend the fish until it forms a smooth, sticky paste. This is what gives the cakes their characteristic bouncy texture. Rough or chunky fish will not bind properly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
